# Commit messages (English only)

Every `git commit` message for this repo **must be in English**.

## Format

- Imperative mood, present tense: `Add…`, `Fix…`, `Update…`, `Remove…`
- Subject ≤ ~72 characters, no trailing period
- Optional body in English explaining *why*
- No French words, accents, or bilingual subjects

## Examples

```text
# Good
Add Mutualis Health subsidiary and sync catalog

# Good
Fix Streamlit deploy path for Community Cloud

# Bad
Ajoute Mutualis Health
# Bad
Mise à jour du README
# Bad
Add filiale Health / ajoute Health
```

When committing for the user, always draft the message in English.
